<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-15" title="Community guidelines" summary="Izzat se baat karein; har insaan ki hadon ka dhyaan rakhein." review={true} related={[{href:'/terms',label:'Terms of use'},{href:'/grievance',label:'Grievance redressal'}]}>
<p>These guidelines apply to conversations and account activity. Respect other people and use the available reporting controls when something goes wrong.</p>
<h2>What is welcome</h2>
<p>Adults aged 18 or older can talk to their favourite influencers over a private call and discuss a shared interest. Astrology and tarot are for reflection and entertainment, with no promised outcomes. Respect a person's decision to decline, end or change the topic.</p>
<p>In the <a href="/women-only">women-only lane</a>, everyday health experiences are a normal topic. Discussing periods, PCOS or pregnancy is not in itself sexual misconduct. Harassment is still reportable. Influencers must not provide medical advice, diagnosis or treatment.</p>
<h2>What is not allowed</h2>
<ul><li>Sexual or suggestive talk, abuse, threats, harassment or coercion.</li><li>Asking for or sharing phone numbers, social accounts, addresses or private contact details.</li><li>Asking for money, selling services or remedies, or arranging meetings.</li><li>Impersonation, false qualifications, or professional medical, legal or financial advice.</li><li>Using the service under 18, sharing another person's private information.</li></ul>
<h2>How reports and strikes work</h2>
<p>Influencers can end a call with <strong>*</strong>, or use <strong>#</strong> to end, block the caller from that influencer and flag an incident. A block stops future contact with that influencer; it does not by itself prove misconduct or permanently ban an account.</p>
<p>No human monitors or listens to your call. Reports go to our team for review. A report is pending until reviewed, and strikes are confirmed only after that review. Mentions of self-harm go to welfare review and must never count as a strike.</p>
<p>The caller policy is a ban after <strong>three confirmed strikes</strong>. Blocking by three distinct influencers can freeze the caller account pending review; two calls ended with the influencer's # key within 24 hours can trigger a 24-hour suspension. These controls cannot guarantee that harm will be detected.</p>
<p>A banned account cannot make calls and cannot re-register with the same phone number. Money is never forfeited: a banned user can still sign in, and unused wallet money can be refunded on request within 180 days. Connected usage remains billable under the <a href="/wallet-terms">wallet terms</a>.</p>
<h2>Live moderation</h2>
<p>Spammy, sexual or threatening behaviour is not allowed. You can end any call yourself, or press # to end the call and block the person. We never ask for OTP, UPI PIN, passwords or bank details; if anyone does, report them.</p>
<p>Influencers also follow the <a href="/hosts/rules">influencer rules</a>. See <a href="/report">Report a user</a> for reporting availability and <a href="/grievance">grievance redressal</a> for the published route to challenge account action. Reporting an incident does not guarantee a particular outcome.</p>
